              { "type": "Paragraph", "set_style": { "style_names": ["iq-breakdown-copy"] }, "set_text": { "text": "Fifty pieces is our starting line because screen printing is a volume game. At one hundred and two hundred fifty pieces, automated press efficiencies kick in hard: setup is amortized across more units, ink and handling costs drop, and your per-shirt price falls dramatically. The calculator above reflects those real production breakpoints." } }
